# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Git exclusion rules for the Aurelia Bank CRM & MCP Server repository.
# Architecture/Context: Root repository configuration enforcing security hygiene
#   by preventing secrets, runtime SQLite files, virtual environments, logs,
#   and build artifacts (including under `mcp_server/`) from entering VCS.
# Dependencies/Side Effects: Consumed by Git CLI and CI/CD pipelines.
# Author: Pradeep Singh
# License: Apache-2.0
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Secrets & Credential Protection
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
gcloud-service-key.json
secrets/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Build, Runtime, Virtual Env & Dependency Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.log
*.pid
nohup.out

# SQLite Runtime Databases & Journals
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
instance/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. OS & IDE Noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
